    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "The section is visually cohesive and polished: strong headline hierarchy, disciplined cyan/red/yellow accents, consistent grid texture, and a well-structured risk card across all viewports. Mobile reflow is particularly clean. However, the actual tablet and mobile headers visibly clip the horizontal navigation mid-item with no clear overflow cue, while several header labels are extremely small and faint; the reported contrast checks are also incomplete. These issues prevent a hackathon-demo-ready 8.",
